# Git 属性：统一行尾、标记二进制、改善 diff
# https://git-scm.com/docs/gitattributes

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- 行尾规范
# 仓库内一律存 LF；检出时也强制 LF（与 .editorconfig 的 end_of_line=lf 保持一致），
# 避免同一批文件在不同系统检出后互相 diff 出一堆「整文件变更」。
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 批处理 / PowerShell 脚本必须 CRLF 才能在 Windows 上正常执行
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# Shell 脚本与 Maven Wrapper 必须 LF，CRLF 会导致 bad interpreter 错误
*.sh  text eol=lf
/mvnw text eol=lf

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- 文本文件与 diff 优化
*.java       text diff=java
*.md         text diff=markdown
*.xml        text
*.yml        text
*.yaml       text
*.json       text
*.properties text
*.sql        text
*.log        text

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- 二进制文件
# 必须声明为 binary，否则 Git 可能误判为文本并做行尾转换，导致文件损坏。
# favicon.ico 就是典型：它是多分辨率二进制图标，容易被 Git 按文本处理。
*.ico   binary
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.webp  binary
*.bmp   binary
*.pdf   binary
*.zip   binary
*.gz    binary
*.tar   binary
*.jar   binary
*.war   binary
*.class binary
*.ttf   binary
*.otf   binary
*.eot   binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.keystore binary
*.jks   binary

# SVG 是文本，可以做 diff
*.svg   text

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- 生成内容
# 不参与 diff、不计入 GitHub 语言统计
target/**  -diff linguist-generated
logs/**    -diff linguist-generated
**/src/main/*/META-INF/** -diff linguist-generated
